{"t":"CFG","made":"2026-11-14 00:19","name":"Citizens Financial Group, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Regional","employees":17609,"hq":"Providence, RI, United States","website":"https://www.citizensbank.com","summary_en":"Citizens Financial Group, Inc. operates as the bank holding company that provides retail and commercial banking products and services to individuals, small businesses, middle-market companies, large corporations, and institutions in the United States. The company operates through two segments, Consumer Banking and Commercial Banking. The Consumer Banking segment offers deposit products, mortgage and home equity lending products, credit cards, business loans, and wealth management services; and education and point-of-sale finance loans, as well as digital deposit products. This segment serves its customers through telephone service centers, as well as through its online and mobile platforms. The Commercial Banking segment provides various financial products and solutions, including lending and leasing, deposit and treasury management services, foreign exchange, and interest rate and commodity risk management solutions, as well as syndicated loans, corporate finance, mergers and acquisitions, and debt and equity capital markets services. The company serves customers and small businesses, high- and ultra-high-net-worth individuals and families, as well as investors, entrepreneurs, and companies and institutions, as well as multifamily, office, industrial, retail, healthcare, and hospitality sectors. The company was formerly known as RBS Citizens Financial Group, Inc. and changed its name to Citizens Financial Group, Inc. in April 2014. Citizens Financial Group, Inc. was founded in 1828 and is headquartered in Providence, Rhode Island.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Citizens Financial Group, Inc.는 미국 내 개인, 중소기업, 중견 기업, 대기업 및 기관에 소매 및 상업 은행 상품과 서비스를 제공하는 은행 지주 회사로 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 소비자 금융과 상업 금융이라는 두 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 소비자 금융 부문은 예금 상품, 모기지 및 주택 담보 대출 상품, 신용 카드, 기업 대출 및 자산 관리 서비스를 제공합니다. 교육 및 POS 금융 대출, 디지털 예금 상품 등이 있습니다. 이 부문은 전화 서비스 센터는 물론 온라인 및 모바일 플랫폼을 통해 고객에게 서비스를 제공합니다. 상업 은행 부문은 대출 및 임대, 예금 및 재무 관리 서비스, 외환, 이자율 및 상품 위험 관리 솔루션은 물론 신디케이트 대출, 기업 금융, 인수 합병, 부채 및 자기 자본 시장 서비스를 포함한 다양한 금융 상품 및 솔루션을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 고객과 중소기업, 고액 및 초고액 개인 및 가족, 투자자, 기업가, 기업 및 기관은 물론 다가구, 사무실, 산업, 소매, 의료 및 숙박 부문에 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 RBS Citizens Financial Group, Inc.로 알려졌으며 2014년 4월에 Citizens Financial Group, Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. Citizens Financial Group, Inc. 1828년에 설립되었으며 로드아일랜드주 프로비던스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":64.4099,"mcap":27000309760.0,"pe":13.012101,"fpe":9.921395,"peg":null,"ps":3.2166202,"pb":1.1820716,"ev_ebitda":null,"div":3.21,"beta":1.095,"hi52":75.33,"lo52":49.0},"fin":{"rev":8393999872.0,"rev_g":0.119,"eps_g":0.343,"gross":0.0,"op":0.34072,"net":0.27019,"roe":0.08896,"fcf":null,"cash":13557999616.0,"debt":17831999488.0,"de":null,"eps":4.95,"feps":6.49202},"own":{"short":0.0,"inst":0.99561,"insider":0.0072600003},"analyst":{"n":19,"mean":76.39474,"median":76.0,"high":87.0,"low":65.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.55,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":5,"buy":12,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":5,"buy":12,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":5,"buy":10,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":5,"buy":10,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-20","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":74.0,"priorPriceTarget":84.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-20","Firm":"Truist Securities","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"Hold","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":70.0,"priorPriceTarget":77.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-20","Firm":"Stephens & Co.","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":65.0,"priorPrice